@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我和艾玛被看守关进了惩罚室。<br>|#0202Adv17_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅也许是因为担心，<br>立刻来到了我们所在的地方。|#0202Adv17_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（该死的……又来了。<br>　为什么连我都要被怀疑！？）|#0202Adv17_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（有问题的是艾玛。<br>　我明明是正确的，是正义的……！）|#0202Adv17_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:二位，对不起。<br>要辛苦你们忍耐到审判了。|#0202Adv17_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅歉疚地皱着眉，<br>似乎是觉得很对不住我们。|#0202Adv17_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说真的我气得不行。<br>　……但只靠愤怒，是无法解决眼下问题的）|#0202Adv17_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（冷静点。好好思考。<br>　到底怎么做才能从审判中突围？）|#0202Adv17_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……首先，必须掌握一些证据）|#0202Adv17_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:……蕾雅，我想麻烦你帮个忙。<br>可以告诉我现在几点吗。|#0202Adv17_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以。不用客气。<br>现在是……14时45分。|#0202Adv17_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅看着自己的手机回答道。|#0202Adv17_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了，还来得及。<br>另外，我还有件事想拜托你。|#0202Adv17_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:只要是我力所能及之事，<br>我都愿意帮忙。|#0202Adv17_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我瞥了眼近在身旁的艾玛，<br>示意蕾雅靠近我一点。|#0202Adv17_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,0 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅察觉到我的意图便靠了过来，<br>我凑到她的耳边。|#0202Adv17_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，希罗……？|#0202Adv17_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

; ＠備考◆コソコソ話

[PrintTextModified Text:去调查地下的焚烧炉。|#0202Adv17_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我悄悄对她说道。|#0202Adv17_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

; ＠備考◆コソコソ話

[PrintTextModified Text:15时焚烧炉就要启动了。<br>快，抓紧去。|#0202Adv17_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……知道了，交给我吧！|#0202Adv17_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅用力点点头，<br>离开了惩罚室。|#0202Adv17_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你和蕾雅说什么了？|#0202Adv17_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有义务回答你。|#0202Adv17_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到我的回答，艾玛垂下眼帘。|#0202Adv17_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……今天早上的希罗，全都是伪装出来的吗。|#0202Adv17_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你跟我说了早安，态度也很温柔……<br>我还高兴地以为，<br>我们又能像以前那样要好了……|#0202Adv17_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不知道你误会了什么。<br>听好了，我，讨厌你。|#0202Adv17_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——讨厌到恨不得杀死你。|#0202Adv17_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:自那以后，我和艾玛再无交谈。|#0202Adv17_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

